![Super Club Net](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/docfxqv0c1t0zxbgqb0i.jpg)

In honor of the Club Nintendo magazine and its HTML mini course.

```ninjas
la-revista-club-nintendo | La Revista Club Nintendo | Mis recuerdos con la revista y como comencé en la informática | /blog/la-revista-club-nintendo/cover.png
```

I wrote this little book updating and expanding the concepts covered
in that magazine.

A free book that can be read on the following websites:

- <https://ninjas.cl/books/superclubnet/>
- mirror: <https://ninjas.codeberg.page/superclubnet/@main/docs/>

## Contents

- Basic HTML and CSS.
- Basic JavaScript.
- DOM manipulation.
- Forms and validation.
- Tips and recommendations.

Friendly writing with examples based on Nintendo 64 games. Includes
a practice project with a Mario Kart 64 theme.

![Mario Kart 64 simulator](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/p1cyc53e2lfzmhjiucq8.png)

Aimed at people just starting out in the HTML world, and maybe at
anyone who wants to refresh their concepts.

Made with much love by [Ninjas.cl](https://ninjas.cl) for everyone
with the curiosity and patience to learn HTML, CSS and JS for web
development :)
